<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects two bln esc, 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects two bln esc, 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected two billion escudos of one-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 5.7 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 5.7023 percent previously.</p>
<p>It offered 10 billion escudos in today's repo.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
